            <tr><td><span class="compare-feature-cell"><span class="compare-feature-name">Prospect</span><span class="compare-feature-desc">Create highly personalised outreach campaigns. Execute 1:1 ABM campaigns with multivariate messaging strategies within 10 mins. Outreach on Email, Linkedin or calls</span></span></td><td><span class="compare-value">Unlimited 1:1 campaigns.<br><br>Personalize messaging to Account</span></td><td><span class="compare-value">Unlimited 1:1 campaigns.<br><br>Personalize messaging to Account, Dept, Title</span></td><td><span class="compare-value">Unlimited 1:Multiple & 1:1 campaigns with Smart Chaining.<br><br>Personalize messaging to Cluster, Account, Dept, Title, Area of Influence (Facility, Regional office, HQ) & to each individual</span></td></tr>
