            <tr><td><span class="compare-feature-cell"><span class="compare-feature-name">AI Credits</span><span class="compare-feature-desc">'Ask Automatisor' any question about your target accounts or facilities and get instant actionable recommendations and deep dives.</span></span></td><td><span class="compare-value">Unlimited</span></td><td><span class="compare-value">Unlimited</span></td><td><span class="compare-value">Unlimited</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="group-row"><td colspan="4"><span class="group-row-body"><span class="group-row-title-row"><span class="group-row-title">Integrations</span></span><span class="group-row-desc">Extend the power of Automatisor with tools already in your prospecting workflow</span></span></td></tr>
